g-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Balto</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Estatua de Balto. Esta estatua rinde homenaje a un valiente Husky Siberiano llamado Balto. En 1925, Nome, en Alaska, se enfrentó a un brote de difteria. Perros de trineo llevaron medicinas que salvaron vidas a través de una terrible ventisca. Balto lideró la última y peligrosa etapa de esta travesía. La estatua se inauguró en Central Park en 1925, pocos meses después del suceso. Fue esculpida por Frederick George Richard Roth. Un detalle único es que el propio Balto estuvo presente en la ceremonia de inauguración de la estatua.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tuggi-primary-text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg>Vista previa de audio</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Idiomas del audio\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200 hover:border-tuggi-primary\">EN</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark border-tuggi-primary\">ES</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200 hover:border-tuggi-primary\">PT-BR</button></div><article class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start bg-white border-gray-200\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reproducir la historia de Balto\" class=\"grid h-14 w-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2\"><div><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Balto</p><p class=\"text-sm text-tuggi-slate\">español</p></div><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Avanzar en la historia de Balto\" aria-valuetext=\"0:00\" class=\"h-6 w-full cursor-pointer accent-tuggi-primary-text disabled:cursor-default\" value=\"0\"/></div><audio preload=\"none\" src=\"https://tysnkzmljlmmqpbotkxv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/travel-app-audios/master_audio/5aa2559b-cc65-5f66-a7d8-9e8757bf4cea/5aa2559b-cc65-5f66-a7d8-9e8757bf4cea-es-es-male.mp3\"></audio></article></div></div></li><li id=\"stop-4\" data-position=\"4\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Giuseppe Mazzini</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">El busto de Giuseppe Mazzini se encuentra en Central Park. Este busto de bronce rinde homenaje a un patriota italiano. Fue obra del escultor Giovanni Turini. La escultura fue donada por italoamericanos y se inauguró en 1878. Giuseppe Mazzini fue una figura clave en el movimiento por la unificación de Italia a mediados del siglo XIX. Fundó el movimiento &quot;Joven Italia&quot;. Su filosofía está inscrita en el pedestal: &quot;Dios y el pueblo&quot; y &quot;pensamiento y acción&quot;. Esta escultura fue el primer monumento a un italiano en Nueva York.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tuggi-primary-text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg>Vista previa de audio</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Idiomas del audio\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200 hover:border-tuggi-primary\">EN</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark border-tuggi-primary\">ES</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border transition-colors bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200 hover:border-tuggi-primary\">PT-BR</button></div><article class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start bg-white border-gray-200\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reproducir la historia de Giuseppe Mazzini\" class=\"grid h-14 w-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/sv