-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">¿Es accesible este recorrido?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Esta ruta está clasificada como: Accesible. Consulta cada parada para más detalles de acceso.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">¿En qué idiomas está disponible?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Este recorrido está disponible en: English, Español, Português, Italiano.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">¿Necesito conexión a internet?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">No. Descarga el recorrido en la app Tuggi y escúchalo sin conexión — el audio se activa según tu ubicación, sin usar las manos.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-8\">Más recorridos cerca</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/es/tours/united-states/cenas-de-cinema-em-nova-york\"><div class=\"bg-tuggi-bg border-b border-gray-100\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 62\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M49.9 40.8L49 43L40.1 39.8L39.7 42.5L38.9 42.4L38.9 42L40.6 41.9L42.1 35.7L42.7 34.4L43.3 35L42.6 34.6L47 26.8L50.1 29L51.3 26.9L50.5 26.4L51.8 23.9L47.8 21.7L47.7 22L49 22.9L50.1 21.2L52.5 22.5L53.5 20.9L54.3 21.3L55.8 19.4L56 18.2L54.3 17.4L52.5 20.7L50.8 19.9L51.1 19.5L53.5 20.8L55.6 16.9L51.7 14.8L50.8 16.4L49.3 15.7L54 7L54.8 7L59.4 10L61.1 7.1L56.5 5L55.2 6.4L53 5.4L40.7 27.8L40.3 30.6L42.2 35.8L46.5 38.5L44.5 44.5L45.8 45.9L50.3 56.5L50.2 57L50 55.9L49.1 55.9L49 53.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-tuggi-primary-text)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"49.9\" cy=\"40.8\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"var(--color-tuggi-primary-text)\"></circle><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"53.9\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"var(--color-tuggi-primary-text)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 p-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tuggi-primary-text mb-2\">New York</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-black text-t